==English==

===Etymology===
Originally a medieval variant of {{m|en|Jack}}; today also used as a diminutive form of {{m|en|Jacob}} and {{m|en|James}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/d͡ʒeɪk/}}
